codex
The failure is now isolated: this execution sandbox reports process PID `2` while `/proc/2` is absent; Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, so its startup fails even though `/proc/self/exe` is valid. I’ll use a minimal audited preload shim that redirects only that equivalent self-executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerun the unchanged pinned binaries and trusted preflight.
apply patch
